	"Description": "[center][size=5]✤[/size]\u00A0[b][size=5]Pig Replacers[/size]\u00A0[/b][size=5]✤[/size][size=5][b][/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][i]How to Install[/i]\n<br />[/size]• Download and install the latest\u00A0[url=https://smapi.io///]SMAPI[/url]\uFEFF and\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1915]Content Patcher[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />• Download and unzip \"K Pig\"\n<br />• Select pattern folder you would like (Solid/Saddle/etc) - inside are all the color variations of each pattern\n<br />• Move one folder starting with [C] to \uFEFF[i]&#92;Stardew Valley&#92;Mods&#92;\n<br />\n<br />[/i]The mod folders are named according to what animal they replace and their pattern. For example,\u00A0[i][C] KPig - Saddle Black\u00A0[/i]replaces the default pig with a black saddleback pig!\n<br />\n<br />Hope you enjoy!\n<br />\n<br />[i][size=4]Other Animal Replacers\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2933][img]https://i.imgur.com/fOl4sea.png[/img]\uFEFF[/url]\uFEFF[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2964/][img]https://i.imgur.com/z7DirGZ.png[/img]\uFEFF[/url]\uFEFF[i][size=4][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2996][img]https://i.imgur.com/7cgqEHI.png[/img][/url]\uFEFF[/size][/i]\n<br />[/size][/i][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2933]Cows[/url]\u00A0✤ [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2964/]Goats[/url]\uFEFF\u00A0\u00A0✤\u00A0 [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2996]Sheep[/url]\uFEFF[/center]",
